WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Vaara: Accountable Autonomy for AI agents

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A verifiable receipt for every action your AI agents take

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Checkable by anyone

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Your AI agent transferred the funds

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Wrote the file, called the tool

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Later, someone asks you to prove what it did

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Vaara provides tamper-evident audit trails

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Open source, EU AI Act Article 12 compliant
